# NetOps Core Rules

Read `AGENTS.md` and `docs/ai/README.md` at session start for large tasks.

## Safety

- No `docker compose down -v`, DB reset, or force push without explicit user approval
- No secrets in commits or logs
- `CONFIG_APPLY_ENABLED` stays false unless user requests production apply
- No SNMP/SSH/discovery on real devices with feature flags OFF

## Structure

- App code: `workspace/artifacts/`
- Docs for AI: `docs/ai/`
- Tests: `tools/*.mjs`
- Do not use `workspace/client` — use `netops-manager`

## Commands

```bash
cd workspace && pnpm run typecheck
docker compose up --build -d
tools/apply-containers.sh api web
```

## Commits

Only when user explicitly asks.
